      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The matter at hand concerns the mining site.",
        "Jp" : "今回問題となっているのは\r\n採掘所についてなのです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544747,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "In days past, the mining site served as one of\r\nthe village's vital lifelines. 'Twould appear,\r\nhowbeit, that a powerful Corruption Demon has\r\nemerged there and begun to lay\r\nwaste to the grounds.",
        "Jp" : "かつては村の生命線の一つでもあった\r\n採掘所に強大な侵食魔があらわれ\r\nその場を荒らし始めたようなのです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544748,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "For the details, Ultan, who is by the field, will\r\nbe able to provide an explanation.\r\nI would ask that you hear his account.",
