      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The mining site, which once stood as one of the\r\nvillage's very lifelines, is being ravaged\r\nby a Corruption Demon.\r\nFor the details, Ultan, who waits by the field,\r\nwill be able to provide an explanation.\r\nI would ask that you hear his account.",
