    "GroupSerial" : 19327,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ser Arisen from a foreign land — shall I explain\r\nthe Corruption Demon that has appeared this time?\r\nI've urgent work at hand, so I'll not abide my\r\nhands to cease — pray excuse me.",
        "Jp" : "異国の覚者様――今回あらわれた侵食魔について\r\nわしがご説明しようかの\r\nちぃとばかり急ぎの作業があっての\r\n手は止めずに失礼しますぞ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 516398,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The inner depths of <SPOT 908> had\r\nlong served as the village's very lifeline, a\r\nmining quarry 'twas. Then, a great Corruption\r\nDemon appeared, and fell to rampaging — hurling\r\nits bulk against the rock face, and suchlike.",
        "Jp" : "――《<SPOT 908>》の奥地は\r\n村の生命線ともいえる採掘所となっていたんじゃ\r\nそこに、大型の侵食魔があらわれて\r\n岩肌に体当たりをしたりと暴れ始めての"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544750,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Should this place be suffered to be ravaged thus,\r\nthen e'en should the corruption abate come some\r\nfuture day, 'twill be rendered unfit for mining—",
        "Jp" : "このまま場を荒らされ続ければ\r\nいつの日か侵食が収まったとしても\r\n採掘に使えなくなってしまう――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544751,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "E'en amid the calamity of corruption, we must\r\nneeds think on what lies beyond.",
        "Jp" : "侵食という災厄の最中にあっても、わしらは\r\nその先のことをも考えねばならんのじゃ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544752,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I pray you put down this Corruption Demon ere the\r\nsite is ravaged any further...",
        "Jp" : "どうか、これ以上あの場が\r\n荒らされないうちに\r\n侵食魔を退治してもらえんかの――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 544753,
      "MsgType" : 0,
