      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah— to think you have already\r\nreturned, the foe vanquished!\r\n'Tis as expected of Ser Arisen, in sooth.\r\nThe might and purity of Arisen...\r\nmethinks they do not vary from region to region.",
        "Jp" : "おお――もう退治してきてくれたとは！\r\nさすがは覚者様じゃ\r\n覚者様の強さ、清さは\r\n国によって変わるものではないのじゃな"
